1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:10,927
(Pigs gruntling, goats bleating)

2
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:22,188
(indistinct voice)

3
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:25,275
We were looking for a cave in the forest.

4
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:29,362
Many Kusundas also used to gather in the forest caves.

5
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:31,614
They stayed in the caves...caves,

6
00:00:31,614 --> 00:00:36,828
sat, talked, laughed and ran.

7
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:38,288
They stayed there in the cave.

8
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:38,830
Hmm...

9
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:41,666
People came to settle in houses in villages.

10
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:42,208
Hmm...

11
00:00:46,045 --> 00:00:50,425
(goats bleating)

12
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:52,844
It was like a home...'There, there...'

13
00:00:54,262 --> 00:00:55,722
..We cooked and ate there.

14
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:56,389
'Yeah...'

15
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:57,682
Like this, we cooked and gave food to people,

16
00:00:57,682 --> 00:00:59,267
for those who came.

17
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,727
We also ate.

18
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:02,270
We lived there.

19
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:09,402
(Gyani Maiya cooking)
